      "id": "dspdV",
      "text": "The six-membered rings are fused to both six and five-membered rings.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kUy6d",
      "text": "Each carbon atom forms three sigma bonds.",
      "isCorrect": false,
