  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Structure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>60</mn></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d4830232-1c2b-473d-afd8-d40daf4f04cd-image.png\" style=\"width: 156px; height: 155px;\" /></p><p>It contain <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> hexagons <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/612a0ba6-6c01-4087-a606-230965af8024-image.png\" style=\"width: 37px; height: 44px;\" /> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> pentagons&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1cf39e67-ae99-412d-a4c7-9d3b1b77d615-image.png\" style=\"width: 47px; height: 44px;\" />&nbsp;so option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> is incorrect.</p>",
